## What was rendered

| File | What it is |
|---|---|
| `src/server.js` | The service `{{serviceName}}`: Node `http` and `net`, no dependencies, listens on {{servicePort}} |
| `Dockerfile` | Builds the service image (`node:22-alpine`, runs as a non-root user) |
| `deploy/k8s/workloads.yaml` | A Deployment and a Service for each node that runs in the cluster |
| `deploy/k8s/gateway-config.yaml` | The gateway's nginx config: forwards every request to `{{appNode}}:{{servicePort}}` |
| `deploy/k8s/network-policy.yaml` | Default deny, DNS, and one or two policies for each `connects` relationship |
| `deploy/k8s/kustomization.yaml` | The kustomize base over the three files above |

The service answers `GET /` (what it was rendered from), `GET /health` and `GET /connections` (a TCP connection
attempt to each node the architecture says it connects to).

